    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step into the world of luxury retail? <strong>Luxury Store Simulator</strong> is a highly detailed business simulation game where you manage an exclusive high-end boutique catering to ultra-wealthy clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, curate the most luxurious products, serve VIP customers, and outshine your competition to build the most prestigious shopping destination!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your day, don\u2019t be late for meetings and sales! Even though you have sales assistants working in your store, only you can close deals with VIP clients \u2014 never forget that, and don\u2019t lose your customers! Your meeting schedule is displayed on your pager, so you can track your daily appointments. Be at the store before time, make sales, and earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better furniture to make your store more functional. Design the layout wisely to offer categorized products to your customers! Purchase sales stands to hire new assistants, so sales don\u2019t stop while you\u2019re out handling business \u2014 the money keeps flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE A TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in touch with people who want to sell second-hand watches or luxury items via email, and give them an appointment in an available time slot. When a customer arrives, inspect the product\u2019s condition, authenticity, and market value before negotiating. Make the right deal and resell the item to make a profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with your customers and make them feel special, so they come back to your store. The stronger the loyalty you build, the more discounts you can offer on repeat purchases \u2014 and the more money you\u2019ll make! Beyond regular buyers, fulfill special orders for VIP customers and be at the store on time to deliver their exclusive products!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEAL WITH DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re willing to take some risks, buy smuggled watches and accessories for a bigger profit. But be careful \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t get caught by the police!</strong> Give appointments at the right place and time. The danger bells can ring at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luxury Store Simulator</strong> is perfect for players who enjoy <strong>business simulation, strategy, and retail management games</strong> with a deep focus on detail and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to run the most luxurious store in the world?</strong> Build your retail empire and dominate the luxury market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Don\u2019t forget to add it to your Wishlist!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to step into the world of luxury retail? <strong>Luxury Store Simulator</strong> is a highly detailed business simulation game where you manage an exclusive high-end boutique catering to ultra-wealthy clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, curate the most luxurious products, serve VIP customers, and outshine your competition to build the most prestigious shopping destination!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your day, don\u2019t be late for meetings and sales! Even though you have sales assistants working in your store, only you can close deals with VIP clients \u2014 never forget that, and don\u2019t lose your customers! Your meeting schedule is displayed on your pager, so you can track your daily appointments. Be at the store before time, make sales, and earn money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/bef79e2d128626918f2820ccefa56615.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR STORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better furniture to make your store more functional. Design the layout wisely to offer categorized products to your customers! Purchase sales stands to hire new assistants, so sales don\u2019t stop while you\u2019re out handling business \u2014 the money keeps flowing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/2f3bd39525f152376d301bd741498dc8.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE A TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in touch with people who want to sell second-hand watches or luxury items via email, and give them an appointment in an available time slot. When a customer arrives, inspect the product\u2019s condition, authenticity, and market value before negotiating. Make the right deal and resell the item to make a profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/8a7e303a775f364c1fa6f895cafcdca9.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with your customers and make them feel special, so they come back to your store. The stronger the loyalty you build, the more discounts you can offer on repeat purchases \u2014 and the more money you\u2019ll make! Beyond regular buyers, fulfill special orders for VIP customers and be at the store on time to deliver their exclusive products!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/70432d665d3075c92cd02a70cc13a47a.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEAL WITH DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re willing to take some risks, buy smuggled watches and accessories for a bigger profit. But be careful \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t get caught by the police!</strong> Give appointments at the right place and time. The danger bells can ring at any moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.poster.avif?t=1747137430\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.webm?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645080/extras/124d2630c1d8d2d8ac821c7ea57e071c.mp4?t=1747137430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who is this game for?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luxury Store Simulator</strong> is perfect for players who enjoy <strong>business simulation, strategy, and retail management games</strong> with a deep focus on detail and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to run the most luxurious store in the world?</strong> Build your retail empire and dominate the luxury market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Don\u2019t forget to add it to your Wishlist!</strong></p>",
